*General strategy ({ko}'s are mostly optional)
**__Base__: tsamra
***ko klama lo mi'a tsamra: Come to our base
**__Team__: bende
***mi nelci le (mi bende|bende be mi): I like the team that includes me / my team
**__Enemy__: bradi
***le bradi bende cu tsali: The enemy team is powerful.
**__Friend / non-enemy__: tolbradi ({mi'a}, or {mi'o} (less frequently), both cmavo, can often also be used when describing your team)
***lo'i tolbradi cu cmalu: The set / number of friends is small.
***loni lo tolbradi cu zasti [kei] cu cmalu: Same
***gunta .ii / .ii gunta: Agh, base!
**__Attack__: gunta
***ko gunta fi'o se kansa mi: Attack with me
***ko gunta ba'i mi: Attack for me (perhaps you're building)
***ko gunta le [bradi] tsamra: Rush / attack the enemy base ({bradi} is usually implied / obvious)
**__Defend__: bandu
***ko bandu: Defend!
***ko bandu le tsamra: Defend the base!
**__Weak__: ruble
***mi ruble: I'm weak!
***mi morsi ruble: I'm weak / perhaps about to die!
***le (mi'a|bradi) tsamra cu ruble: The (our/enemy) base is weak!
***le (mi'a|bradi) tsamra cu mutce ruble: The (our/enemy) base is very weak!
***le (mi'a|bradi) tsamra cu dukse ruble: The (our/enemy) base is too weak!
**__Retreat__: rixmu'u / zilxru [lonu na gunta]
***ko rixmu'u: Retreat!
**__Advance__: cramu'u
***ko cramu'u: Advance!
**__Cease attacking__: co'u gunta / sisti lonu gunta / sisti co gunta / gunta sisti
***ko co'u gunta: Cease attacking
**__Begin attacking__: ko ca'a gunta / ko gasnu lonu gunta / ko gasnu lonu lonu gunta cu cfari
***ko co'a gunta: Begin attacking
**__Kill__: catra
***ko catra mi: kill me (perhaps you got stuck in buggy part of a map and it would be more convenient to be teamkilled rather than wait for your poison to take effect
**__Chase / attack / pursue weak enemy player__: jersi
***ko jersi [catra]: Chase (presumably with an intent of killing)! / [Chase-type of kill!]
**__Move (presumably out of the way) / stop blocking__: muvdu [dapoi na zunti]
***ko muvdu: Move!
**__Camping__: badcando
***lo bradi cu badcando: The enemy is camping
***ko co'u badcando / ko sisti lonu do badcando: Stop camping!
** __Not camping / aggressive / attacking / defending__: to'e badcando
***mi nelci lonu mi kelci lo to'e badcando po'o: I like playing with those who don't camp only
**__Dying__: morsi
***[mi] bazi morsi: [I will] soon die!
**__Low on health__: sotka'o
***[mi] sotka'o: [I'm] low health!
***[le bradi cu] sotka'o: [The enem(y|ies)] low health!
**__State of stage 1__: <pamoi?> <todo> ???
**__State of stage 2__: <remoi?> <todo> ???
**__State of stage 3__: <cimoi?> <todo> ???
**__Ammunition / ammo__: danti
***kunti lo dalti: Out of ammo!
***so'u [lo] dalti [cu co'e]: Little ammo!
***li no ni lo dalti cu zasti: There is no ammo!
***li so'u ni lo dalti cu zasti: There is little ammo!
***no [lo] dalti cu (zasti|ponse [mi|le bradi cu]): [I/the enem(y|ies)] have no ammo!
***so'u [lo] dalti cu (zasti|ponse [mi|le bradi cu]): [I/the enem(y|ies)] have little ammo!
**__(One who) flank__: nalkanpynelkargunta / mlaguta
***.o'i mlaguta: Flank!
**__Behind!__: trixe .o'i
***trixe .o'i: Look out (behind)!
**__Sudden death__: ???
**__Wait__: denpa
***ko denpa lonu mi gunta kei lonu do cando: Wait for me to attack while you're inactive
***ko denpa lonu mi gunta kei fo lonu do gunta: Wait for me to attack before you to attack
**__Soon (tense cmavo)__: [ba]zi
***mi [ba]zi gunta: I will soon attack
**__Control point__: bedka'edai (note: stress is always on the penultimate syllable for brivla, so this is also {bedka'Edai})
***mi jibni lo bedka'edai: I'm near a Control Point
**__Completely captured (control point)__: selmulkavbu
***le mi'a bende cu [ca] selmulkavbu pa [lo] [ci] bedka'edai: Our team has one [out of three] points *completely* captured
***le mi'a bende cu [ca] selmulkavbu [binxo] galfi pa [lo] [ci] bedka'edai: Our team is capturing one [out of three] points
**__Neutral (control point)__: na selmulkavbu, narselzilkavbu, narselroldzakavbu
***no [lo] bedka'edai cu na selmulkavbu: No control point is neutral
**__Healing__: ???
**__Building__: ???
***[le mi'a bende cu] nitcu lo <Building>: [Our team] need builder(s)!
**__Main / primary entrance / middle__: ralnerkalri
***ko klama [le [mi'a|bradi] tsamra] fo lo ralnerkalri: Come [to [our|enemy] base] via the main entrance
**__Alternate / secondary entrance / halls__: relralnerkalri
**__Non-main entrance__: nalralnerkalri
**__Away / not present / inactive__: di'a jundi / na zvati (stop attentive / not present)
***: di'a jundi: AFK/BRB/away/not paying attention
**__Inactive__: cando
***: le bradi bende cu cando: The enemy team is inactive / idle
**__Toilet (presumably afk)__: vimstizu
***vimstizu: Toilet!
**__Win__: ???
**__Loses__: ???
**__Client / Player / Soldier__: sonci
***du'e sonci cu badcando: Too many players are camping (note that, again, we've omitted {lo} after the PA (number) valsi}
**__Credits__: remna jdini / jdini lo remna bende
***mi nitcu lo [remna jdini] zmadu [lonu mi terve'u lo <shotgun>]: I need more [credits] [to buy a shotgun]
**__Evolution points / frags (alien evolution point sense)__: nalre'a jdini / jdini lo nalre'a bende
***mi ponse no nalre'a jdini: I have zero evolution points
**__Frags (kills in game sense)__: [kelci] nilcatra
***.i mi mutce nelci tu'a so'i nilcatra
**__Together / with__: kansa
***.e'u ko kansa mi [lonu gunta]: Let's group / operate together [in attacking]
**__Leader__: jatna
***.i .e'u mi jatpa: I'll lead?  (To which ones could reply {vi'o} or {go'i})
**__Backup / reinforcement / grouped teammates__: ???
**__Feeding / giving enemy team too many / an excessive amount of funds__: 
**__Need__: nitcu
***le bradi bende cu nitcu lo jdini: The enemy team needs funds
***mi nitcu lonu do klama: I need to you come
***mi nitcu tu'a do: I need you
**__Team has__: ??? (not necessarily owns?  A team doesn't necessarily own players / points / buildables?)

*Teams
**__Aliens__: se nalremterdi (or more informally, nalre'a)
**__Humans__: remna
**__Spectators__: ???

*Buildables
**__Spawn (telenode or egg)__: ???
***no nalre'a <spawn> [cu co'e]: No aliens spawns!  ([co'e] is implied without a selbri; if one takes the time to express is, it may as well be zasti)
***zasti fa no nalre'a <spawn>: Wordier but more explicit example meaning pretty much the same thing
***no <spawn> co nalre'a: If it's obvious which team has no spawns, it can be more convenient to express "spawns" first.
